    "name": "fal Model APIs Apps Storage API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The fal Model APIs are a unified queue-based REST surface for invoking 1,000+ production generative image, video, audio, and multimodal models hosted on fal's GPU inference infrastructure. Clients submit a job to `https://queue.fal.run/{model-owner}/{model-name}`, then either poll for status and result, subscribe via webhook, or stream incremental progress.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: fal Support",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
